      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Loss event (links to VS-23); anomaly; tip/complaint
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~10–50 investigations/year
Owner: Loss Prevention Manager
Participants: Loss Prevention Mgr (links to VS-23), Security, Legal, User Dept, Agency, HR
Source: workflow W3229 — Contractor Fraud, Theft &amp; Background Investigation</bpmn:documentation>
