      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Misclassification finding (W3226); 5-month/6-month statutory thresholds; strategic insource decision (W3231)
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~50–200 conversions/year
Owner: Labor Compliance Manager
Participants: Labor Compliance Mgr, HR (links to VS-19), Payroll (links to VS-19.2), Finance, Legal
Source: workflow W3230 — Conversion-to-Regular &amp; Headcount Boundary Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3230_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3230_Lane1" name="Labor Compliance Mgr">
