        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3230_Start4" name="Misclassification finding (W3226); 5-month/6-month statutory thresholds; strategic…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3230_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3230_Task5" name="Labor Compliance/HR identify conversion triggers: workers approaching statutory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Labor Compliance/HR identify conversion triggers: workers approaching statutory engagement-duration thresholds (6-month constructive-regularization per W555 context), misclassification findings (W3226), strategic insourcing (W3231), performance-based conversion offer; compute back-pay/ benefits liability (W3215)
Responsible (R): Labor Compliance Mgr / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3230_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3230_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3230_Task6" name="HR/Recruitment (links to VS-19.1) execute conversion: offer regular employment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Recruitment (links to VS-19.1) execute conversion: offer regular employment, onboard as employee (master data, SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG enrollment, contract), calculate and pay back-wages/benefits/13th-month/SIL per NLRC/DOLE order where applicable; recover from agency per indemnity where contractually liable
Responsible (R): HR / Payroll / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3230_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3230_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3230_Task7" name="Manage headcount boundary: maintain ratio guardrails (W3209), update workforce…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage headcount boundary: maintain ratio guardrails (W3209), update workforce plan (links to VS-19.3), ensure converted roles reflected in headcount/budget (links to VS-33/VS-17.4); monitor for future triggers
Responsible (R): Labor Compliance Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3230_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3230_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3230_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3230_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
