    <bpmn:process id="W_W3231" name="W3231. Outsourced Function Transition &amp; Insourcing/Outsourcing Decisions" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategic review (W3209); performance/compliance failure; cost benchmarking; capability-build
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~1–5 function transitions/year
Owner: Contingent Workforce Manager
Participants: Contingent Workforce Mgr, HR, User Dept, Finance, Legal, Procurement, Change (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3231 — Outsourced Function Transition &amp; Insourcing/Outsourcing Decisions</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3231_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3231_Lane1" name="Contingent Workforce Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3231_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3231_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3231_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3231_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3231_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3231_Start3" name="Strategic review (W3209); performance/compliance failure; cost benchmarking…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3231_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3231_Task4" name="Build business case for insource/outsource: total-cost comparison (W3209)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build business case for insource/outsource: total-cost comparison (W3209), capability/quality/control considerations, risk (W3226), strategic alignment, capital/transition cost (W3188 for facilities, VS-99 for technology); obtain approval per authority matrix
Responsible (R): Contingent Workforce Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 4–8 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3231_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3231_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3231_Task5" name="Plan and execute transition: for insource — recruit/hire (links to VS-19.1)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Plan and execute transition: for insource — recruit/hire (links to VS-19.1), train (links to VS-19.4), build capability, convert where applicable (W3230), terminate outsource contract (W3216); for outsource — select agency (W3210), structure contract (W3211), transfer function/knowledge, redeploy employees
Responsible (R): Contingent Workforce Mgr / HR / User Dept
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: 8–24 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3231_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3231_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3231_Task6" name="Stabilize and measure: post-transition review, KPI baseline and tracking…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Stabilize and measure: post-transition review, KPI baseline and tracking, lessons-learned, update workforce plan (links to VS-19.3) and category strategy (W3209); manage any residual legal/employee-relations issues (links to VS-84)
Responsible (R): Contingent Workforce Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: 8–12 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3231_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3231_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3231_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3231_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
