        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-525 (ensure controlled execution — Contingent Workforce Performance, Risk &amp; Spend Analytics (PA-98.3).) | - operational: phased transition and overlap; operational: legal structuring and engagement
Owner: Contingent Workforce Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3231_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3231_Annotation8" targetRef="W3231_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
