    <bpmn:process id="W_W3232" name="W3232. Workforce Composition Strategy &amp; Integrated Workforce Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategic cycle; major operating-model change
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: Enterprise-wide integrated workforce
Owner: CHRO
Participants: CHRO, Contingent Workforce Mgr, HR (links to VS-19), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Strategy (links to VS-33), User Depts
Source: workflow W3232 — Workforce Composition Strategy &amp; Integrated Workforce Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3232_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3232_Lane1" name="CHRO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3232_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3232_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3232_Lane2" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3232_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3232_Lane3" name="Exec Committee">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3232_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3232_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3232_Start5" name="Annual strategic cycle; major operating-model change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3232_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3232_Task6" name="CHRO/Strategy (links to VS-33) build integrated workforce plan: total workforce…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CHRO/Strategy (links to VS-33) build integrated workforce plan: total workforce (employees + contingent + outsourced functions), composition targets by function/location, build/buy/borrow decisions, capability/skills strategy, future-state for growth (10–15 new stores/year) and automation (links to VS-30); reconcile with budget (links to VS-33/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): CHRO / Contingent Workforce Mgr / Strategy
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 6–10 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3232_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3232_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3232_Task7" name="Finance model total cost of workforce: employee comp+benefits (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance model total cost of workforce: employee comp+benefits (links to VS-19.2), contingent spend (W3227), outsourced-function cost (W3231), management overhead, compliance/risk premium; scenario analysis (growth, downturn, automation)
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst / CHRO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 3–5 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3232_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3232_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3232_Task8" name="Approve and cascade composition strategy; integrate into VS-19 hiring plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Approve and cascade composition strategy; integrate into VS-19 hiring plan, VS-34 procurement plan, and VS-33 strategic plan; monitor composition KPIs quarterly (employee-to-contingent ratio, contractor conversion rate, insource/outsource balance) and adjust
Responsible (R): Exec Committee
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3232_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3232_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3232_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3232_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3232_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-525 (ensure controlled execution — Contingent Workforce Performance, Risk &amp; Spend Analytics (PA-98.3).) | - operational: integrated planning and ratio KPIs; operational: capability strategy (links to VS-19)
Owner: CHRO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
